      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14152215/assets/fb3c9b1a249cfd2b6f13e2e7b3a731549094b7e6ea38432d5dcd000a7083f7ec.png)\n\nDetermine the measure of the angle $∠ABC$ shown above.",
      "worked_solution": "We will use a protractor to determine the measure of the angle $∠ABC.$ \n\nTo do this, we read the degrees where the side $\\overset{\\to }{BA}$ of the angle intersects the scale of numbers:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14152215/assets/8a89b7b52135983b18892d07e173b95d7afdcc1efaa4b9c91fb0013b26d279fc.png)\n\nTherefore, we have that $m∠ABC={120}^{∘}.$",
