    "q-67608": {
      "dom_id": "step-q67608",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14152215/assets/b7cda3efc4a07a69c5cd389b59bb0ef18b55b5e58d38405cf211ea27e7dab4a5.png)\n\nDetermine the measure of the angle $∠ABC$ shown above.",
      "worked_solution": "Let's use the upper scale of the protractor.\n\n- The side $\\overset{\\to }{BA}$ of the angle intersects the upper scale of numbers at ${25}^{∘}.$\n\n- The side $\\overset{\\to }{BC}$ intersects the upper scale of numbers at ${155}^{∘}.$\n\nTo find the measure of $∠ABC,$ we subtract the smaller reading from the larger one and get\n\n$$\nm∠ABC={155}^{∘}-{25}^{∘}={130}^{∘}.\n$$",
