      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14152215/assets/ccda9a0334c7981def5e4a3f96cc6a22c9e71cc1218b8e1b6dc8084f08abbffa.png)\n\nDetermine the measure of the angle $∠ABC$ shown above.",
      "worked_solution": "Let's use the upper scale of the protractor.\n\n- The side $\\overset{\\to }{BA}$ of the angle intersects the upper scale of numbers at ${145}^{∘}.$\n\n- The side $\\overset{\\to }{BC}$ intersects the upper scale of numbers at ${65}^{∘}.$\n\nTo find the measure of $∠ABC,$ we subtract the smaller reading from the larger one and get\n\n$$\nm∠ABC={145}^{∘}-{65}^{∘}={80}^{∘}.\n$$",
